# research/ is TRACKED. It was ignored as "large, regenerable" until the second
# half of that turned out to be the expensive half: 342 of 353 reports were lost
# because nothing outside one machine held them, and the manifest recorded 353
# successes against 11 surviving files. Regenerating costs a paid Edison call
# per trait (~7.5 min each), so these are provenance, not build output.
